{
  "esm": "2.4.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_frame",
    "description": "The three-region layout shared by every conservative variable-coefficient vertical diffusion d/dz(K du/dz) on column_nonuniform_1d with the coefficient K on the INTERFACES, whatever closes the two domain faces: a makearray tiling lev whose interior [2, NLEV-1] is stencils/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior, (G[k+1] - G[k]) / dz[k], and whose two boundary layers are L u[1] = ( G[2] - G_bot ) / dz[1] and L u[NLEV] = ( G_top - G[NLEV] ) / dz[NLEV], every interior flux G[n] = K[n] (u[n]-u[n-1])/(zc[n]-zc[n-1]) being stencils/interface_flux_K_lev (applied at n = 2 and n = NLEV here). The two domain-face fluxes are PARAMETERS: G_bot is the diffusive flux K du/dz through the surface face (z = ze[1]) and G_top through the top face (z = ze[NLEV+1]), both positive in the +lev (upward) direction, bound by the applying match rule to whatever its boundary condition makes them -- the free names kdudz_bot / kdudz_top in rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc (prescribed fluxes), the two-point law stencils/interface_flux_K_two_point closed against supplied boundary values in rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_value_bc. So the interior stencil, the region layout and the two boundary-layer flux differences have one spelling, and the telescoping identity sum_k dz[k] L u[k] = G_top - G_bot holds structurally for every closure: the column integral of u changes only through the two face fluxes. A match-less rule template (it never fires on its own); the bc: tag names what it takes, not a closure it imposes. Params: u, the [lev] layer field; K, the [lev_nodes] interface coefficient; G_bot and G_top, scalar expressions. `zc` and `dz` are the consumer's free-name geometry observeds (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/grid.esm). Minimum extent NLEV = 2: the interior region folds to the empty [2, 1] and the two boundary layers, which read G[2] = G[NLEV], cover the column; at NLEV = 1 the interior region folds to the inverted [2, 0] and the load is rejected with makearray_region_inverted (esm-spec 4.3.2) rather than reading u[0].",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "op:varcoeff_laplacian",
      "axes:lev",
      "order:2",
      "stencil_width:3",
      "bc:supplied_face_flux",
      "spec:9.6.8"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.13 (nonuniform grids)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "operator_imports": [
    { "ref": "../stencils/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior.esm" },
    { "ref": "../stencils/interface_flux_K_lev.esm" }
  ],
  "operators": {
    "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_frame": {
      "params": ["u", "K", "G_bot", "G_top"],
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[2, { "op": "-", "args": ["NLEV", 1] }]],
          [[1, 1]],
          [["NLEV", "NLEV"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "apply_operator",
            "args": [],
            "name": "varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_interior",
            "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K" }
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "apply_operator",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev",
                    "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K", "n": 2 }
                  },
                  "G_bot"
                ]
              },
              { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 1] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "G_top",
                  {
                    "op": "apply_operator",
                    "args": [],
                    "name": "interface_flux_K_lev",
                    "bindings": { "u": "u", "K": "K", "n": "NLEV" }
                  }
                ]
              },
              { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", "NLEV"] }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
